<!-- Zip &amp; Zap (Less Explicit) on TomSVR_comad, a personal fork of Jotego's jtgals core (5 MB CPU ROM
     plus a 1 MB extension ROM at 0xB00000, OKI at 0xA80001, palette-based fg transparency). The ROM is assembled from your own MAME zip(s) and patched (work RAM relocated,
     VU-002 sprites converted to Pandora format each frame;
     Zip &amp; Zap hardware differences patched: RAM, OKI, IRQ4 task tick, bootleg VU-002 sprite list). Requires TomSVR_comad.rbf. -->
